WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.360
I only just got off night shift!

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.300
It's an emergency! You know this is no 
time to be saying things like that.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:09.800
Hey!

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.950
Once you've given your reports, 
head to the front counter.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.130
We're running short-handed!

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:16.560
What's going on?

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.000
We're very sorry!

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.990
Tell us straight!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.520
With regard to the monster 
that appeared yesterday,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.120
the Guild is still examining 
the information...

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.240
A child was attacked, right? 
You think things are fine?

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:30.120
We are working hard to quickly 
understand the situation, but...

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.150
Tulle, you're done here.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.020
Team leader? But...

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.890
The head of the Guild has asked for you.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:36.570
What?

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.310
You wanted to see me?

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:48.990
Deliver this directive to 
Bell Cranel of the Hestia Familia.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.760
To Mister Cranel?

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.700
Further inquiry is forbidden.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.750
This duty is of absolute secrecy.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:59.940
The Guild is officially tasking the 
Hestia Familia with a mission.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:24.020
<b>Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III</b>

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.010
Xenos
Outliers

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.210
A... mission?

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.290
Yes.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.330
I'm sure you are already aware of this,

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:41.800
but missions, unlike quests, are compulsory 
tasks given by the Guild.

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:43.960
You can't refuse to do them.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:53.240
Usually, they're given to larger familias...

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.930
I don't know why Hestia Familia
 has been chosen.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:06.950
"Proceed to the 20th Floor
 with the dragon girl."

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.200
<i>It can't be... Why?</i>

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.260
<i>How does the Guild know about Wiene?</i>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:13.960
Bell-kun?

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.170
Are you all right?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.790
I'm... fine.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:26.190
Bell-kun, ask me for advice.

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:31.450
I want to help you. So please—

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.070
If you'll excuse me.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.860
So, you're saying they found out 
because of the riot yesterday?

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:50.230
No. They're moving much too 
quickly for that to be the case.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.200
They're even aware of Wiene-sama's species.

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:56.200
I can only think that they learned 
of this at an earlier stage.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:00.200
But I have no idea of the Guild's aim in this.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.830
Instead of trying to restrain us,

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:05.920
or demanding we hand over Wiene-sama...

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:10.010
"Go to the Dungeon's Twentieth Floor," they say.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:13.490
Why must Wiene-sama accompany us, I wonder.

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:17.330
I don't know. Maybe they're trying 
to force something to happen?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.660
Can we even make it there?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.530
Just us, all the way down 
to the Twentieth Floor.

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.090
That's...

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.140
It'll be our first time
to that floor for all of us.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:29.430
There's no guarantee of safety. 
We've got one shot at making it.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.710
If we use Haruhime-sama's 
magic to raise our levels,

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:35.570
we should meet the criteria 
to reach that floor.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.550
It's just that, it's true,

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:40.340
there is no denying that it will 
be a dangerous expedition.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.400
What will we do?

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.340
Lili and the others never 
had any right to refuse this.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:47.510
I'm sorry.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.550
For things to have turned out like this...

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:52.790
Bell-sama...

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.550
The fact that you saved Wiene-sama...

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.350
Please don't ever regret doing that.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:05.580
I was saved by everyone, and now I am happy.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.350
I am certain Wiene-sama is the same!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:09.520
So please...

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.000
I guess she's just saying, "Don't apologize."

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:21.200
Being a familia means we 
support each other, right?

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.920
We all share the same fate!

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.880
Right, Li'l Lili?

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:31.860
I suppose there's no helping it. 
Lili is Bell-sama's supporter, after all.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:33.850
I will accompany you wherever you go.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.310
Lili...

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.630
Bell?

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.560
I have something to talk to you about, Wiene.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.610
Dungeon?

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.540
Yes. I want you to come with us.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:23.720
You don't want to?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.060
No, I'll go.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:30.510
Wiene...

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.410
I'm scared, but...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.500
If I'm with everyone, it won't be scary.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.750
Thank you for always protecting me.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.690
Bell...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:52.800
I love you.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:09.160
You lot! Keep an eye out
for the Hestia Familia!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.570
So things are starting to move, are they?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.520
Using Bell-kun and the others as a lure...

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:18.320
That Ouranos.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.380
I'll count on you to handle the rest,

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.450
Asfi.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:31.630
Bell...

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.640
It's all right.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.860
Goddess!

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.350
We'll be back!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.120
Right! Be careful on your way!

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:46.800
Now, then.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.420
Was it you? The one who called me out here.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:08:00.860
Greetings upon our 
first meeting, Goddess Hestia.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:04.630
I am obliged to you for putting yourself 
through the trouble of coming here.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.660
"After your family has departed,"

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:09.890
"come to 4th Street in the Seventh District."

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.760
To think of leaving a message 
using sacred letters...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.780
It's a roundabout way of doing things.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.970
Are you really a person?

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.370
You seem like...

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:25.460
Oh, dear... It seems that before a deity, 
any disguise is rendered pointless.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.410
Quickly! To the Eighteenth Floor!

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:42.970
Hurry, Bell!

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.000
Right!

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.470
Firebolt!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.080
Beyond this point is the Nineteenth Floor.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.100
This is where the true test starts.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.820
This is our final check.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.750
Welf-sama, how many magic swords do we have?

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.320
Three.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.720
I've had them set aside without using them.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:09.390
Haruhime-sama, once we enter 
the Nineteenth Floor,

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.230
use your level boost on Welf-sama.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.060
I will.

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.250
Mikoto-sama, you'll use your skill.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.600
I understand.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.690
Leave the search for enemy monsters to me.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.370
Let's go!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:41.390
To think a path like this existed.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:45.690
Almost no one knows of this secret byway.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:50.240
And those who have used it could be easily 
counted on the fingers of one hand.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:55.060
Is this a secret passage created to 
give your master a way to escape?

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:00.020
Huh?

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.670
A dead end?

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:23.090
My role ends here.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.590
It has been some time, hasn't it, Hestia?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.950
I thought it was you,

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.690
Ouranos.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.920
This mission... Was that something 
you decided yourself?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.340
It was.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.630
Bell-kun and the others are safe, I assume.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:03.600
It was the Dungeon they entered. 
I cannot make any guarantees.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:07.890
Wiene!

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.330
Bell!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.280
Stay behind me!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.120
Get back, Bell!

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:23.900
A fresh wave is approaching!

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.510
I'll use a magic sword!

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.590
So this is the Twentieth Floor.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.810
I'm sorry for using a precious magic sword.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.620
No, that was for the best.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.940
If you'd been a little later, 
it would have been bad.

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:52.840
Welf, Lili, are you all right?

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.790
Yeah, we're fine.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.740
I'm glad... I'm so glad!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.070
It's because everyone is so strong.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:00.970
Yeah!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:07.330
Bell-dono, it does seem that the monsters 
are all targeting only Wiene-dono.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.110
Yes.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.620
I will guard her as best I can,

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.690
but if they suddenly attack, 
as they did just now...

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:14.710
It's all right.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.750
I will protect Wiene no matter what.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.850
You called me here because of Wiene-kun,

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:24.440
the dragon girl, is that right?

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:29.170
What is she? What is happening 
in the Dungeon right now?

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:31.770
What are you hiding?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.810
What is your divine intention?

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:40.730
I shall tell you everything, Hestia.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.690
Lili-dono, is this really the place?

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:48.910
Th-There is no mistake. This should be correct.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.340
There's... nothing here.

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:52.000
Damn it!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:55.200
What is the Guild trying to make us do?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.260
Huh? Wiene?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.280
I can hear it...

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:15.640
A song.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.570
What?

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:26.320
She's right. I can hear it!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.490
Where is it coming from?

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:32.200
A song that echoes through the labyrinth?

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.330
Is it calling to someone?

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.530
So it's telling us to keep going, then.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.310
Lili-dono, what is this place?

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.830
It isn't on the map. 
It is unexplored territory.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.330
Bell-sama?

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:28.140
Mikoto-san... are there monsters here?

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:31.250
I-I have not detected any!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.130
We're being watched.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.690
Stay on guard!

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:44.710
Is that...

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.010
Damn it! How many are there?

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:05.420
I'll use some lamp moss!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.260
Wh-What is all this?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.570
Armed monsters?

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.470
Will these monsters also target Wiene-dono?

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.870
Wiene!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:53.230
<i>This lizardman is strong!</i>

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.600
Wiene-sama!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.690
It... hurts...

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:58.560
Wiene!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:06.930
Wiene...

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:16.730
No!

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:17.950
Wiene-sama!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.280
No you don't!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.280
I will not allow it!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.740
Bell...

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.070
Hup!

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:18.970
This is fun. I've never 
met adventurers like you!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:27.160
I did tell you, didn't I, Lyd? 
They are different.

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.340
Hey, you're...

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:32.440
We meet again, both of you.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:40.600
Rei! Yes, it's just like you said.

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.790
These adventurers are different!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:46.120
Sorry about that. We were testing you.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:47.450
Testing us?

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:50.020
Yeah. We wanted to know.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.680
The group that took in our kin... 
What kind of people are they?

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:56.790
When things got rough, would 
they just abandon her?

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:00.620
We scared you, and we ended 
up hurting you, too...

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.960
Sorry about that.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:03.920
Um...

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.520
Let me say this properly.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.510
Thank you for protecting 
our kin for all this time.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:18.290
It is not certain when their 
existences came into being.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:22.940
But after observing their existence 
and coming into contact with them,

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:28.200
we are providing them aid under 
the guise of protection.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:31.590
Aid? The Guild is helping monsters?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.250
What are you thinking?

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.250
That is correct.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:39.430
Just as you protected that dragon girl.

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:46.010
The aim of the current mission was 
to deliver her to her comrades.

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:48.730
Then... right now, 
Bell-kun and the others are...

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:49.970
Yes.

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:54.940
If they survived, then they should
be arriving at their hidden village.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.900
Light the lights, everyone!

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:08.490
Th-There are this many?

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.830
I'm Lyd.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.740
As you can see, I'm a lizardman.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:18.260
Pleased to meet you, Bell Cranel.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.850
I, um...

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.510
Hey. You mind if I call you Bell-cchi?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.030
Huh? I, um...

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:25.730
P-Please, feel free.

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:26.920
Bell-cchi!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.400
Yes?

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.080
Let's shake hands.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.780
Bell-sama!

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:00.410
P-Pleased to meet you!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:07.010
Yeah. Good to meet you!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:17.730
It's such an honor to meet you!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.240
Please allow me to greet you properly!

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.350
Me, too!

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.890
Oh! No, I... Just...

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:31.530
She doesn't speak, but it seems she 
likes you, person from the surface.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:33.630
"She"? You mean, she's female?

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:40.500
May I ask your name?

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.520
Wiene.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:49.930
Wiene...

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:52.480
That's a lovely name.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.720
Pleased to meet you, our new kin.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:58.230
Kin?

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:02.660
Yes. Here there are none who 
will oppress or persecute you.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.620
We gladly welcome you.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:16.460
Please, tell me.

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:20.350
All of you... and Wiene... what are you?

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:24.100
We are labeled as those who 
counter that which is known...

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:32.860
We are called...

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:33.990
Xenos.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.400
Xenos?

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.750
Yes.

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:41.240
Monsters that possess intelligence.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:44.100
That is what we call them.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.890
And...

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.450
Hestia.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:52.140
You and that family of yours 
are both their hope and mine.

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:53.360
Hope?

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:55.770
Humanity and monsters...

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:58.970
You are the bridge to their co-existence.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Aspiration
Distant Dream</b>

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:38.360
Next time,

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:39.490
"Aspiration."
